# Canonicalize the www host to the apex domain with a clean 301, matching the
# canonical tag, sitemap, Open Graph, and structured data (all use lalumapp.com
# with no www). This resolves the "broken redirects" a crawler sees on www.
https://www.lalumapp.com/*  https://lalumapp.com/:splat  301!

# Legacy Wix path-based language routing (Wix Multilingual, SUBDIRECTORY URL
# structure). The old Wix site served English, Spanish, French, and Arabic
# under /en/..., /es/..., /fr/..., /ar/... path prefixes; the app switches
# language with a ?lang=xx query param instead, so any indexed/bookmarked
# language link now 404s. Redirect each prefix off and preserve the rest of
# the path as the query param.
/en       /?lang=en        301
/en/*     /:splat?lang=en  301
/es       /?lang=es        301
/es/*     /:splat?lang=es  301
/fr       /?lang=fr        301
/fr/*     /:splat?lang=fr  301
/ar       /?lang=ar        301
/ar/*     /:splat?lang=ar  301

# Legacy Wix default page slugs, confirmed 404ing on the live domain (found
# /about live; the rest are the same class of Wix-default slug and equally
# likely indexed/bookmarked). Best-effort mapping to the closest equivalent
# in the new app, pending the full old-site URL list for a precise redirect
# map (see task: compare against Wix's old sitemap / Search Console export).
/about      /            301
/contact    /book        301
/services   /advisory    301
/team       /            301
/blog       /insights    301

# SPA fallback: serve the app shell for every in-app route.
/*    /index.html   200
